<title>USA: Kohl's Corp July same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Kohl's Corp July same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kohl's Corp said Tuesday that comparable store sales for the four week period ended August 3 rose 12.1 percent.</p>
<p>Total store sales for the period were $182.8 million, up 31.4 percent from $139.2 million a year ago, the company said.</p>
